  "solution": "Given : 7 * 2 * 5 * 4 * 2 * 15\n\n**Option1)** ÷, -, +, ×, =\n\nReplacing * with mathematical signs, we get\n\n**__7 ÷ 2__** - 5 + 4 × 2 = 15\n\n3.5 - 5 + **__4 × 2__** = 15\n\n**__3.5__** - 5 __**+ 8**__ = 15\n\n**__11.5 - 5__ **=** 15**\n\n**6.5 **≠ 15\n\n**LHS ≠ RHS** \n\n**Option 2)** -, ÷, +, ×, =\n\nReplacing * with mathematical signs, we get\n\n7 - **__2 ÷ 5__** + 4 × 2 = 15\n\n7 – 0.4 + **__4 × 2__** = 15\n\n**7** – 0.4 **+ 8** = 15\n\n**__7 + 8 __**– 0.4 = 15\n\n15 – 0.4 = 15\n\n**14.6 ≠ 15**\n\n**LHS ≠ RHS** \n\n**Option 3) +, ×, -, ÷, =**\n\n**Replacing * with mathematical signs, we get**\n\n7 + 2 × 5 - **__4 ÷ 2__** = 15\n\n7 + **__2 × 5__** – 2 = 15\n\n**__7 + 10__** – 2 = 15\n\n**17 – 2 = 15**\n\n**15 = 15**\n\n**LHS = RHS**\n\n**Option 4)** ×, -, +, ÷, =\n\nReplacing * with mathematical signs, we get\n\n7 × 2 - 5 +**__ 4 ÷ 2 __**= 15\n\n**__7 × 2__** - 5 + 2 = 15\n\n__**14**__ – 5 __**+ 2**__ = 15\n\n**__14 + 2__** – 5 = 15\n\n16 – 5 = 15\n\n**11 ≠ 15**\n\n**LHS ≠ RHS**\n\nHence, the correct answer is **\"Option 3\".**",
